<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40404" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίορκ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sworn falsely</i>, of
			oaths, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ δέ τι τῶνδ᾽ ἐπίορκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.264
				</span></i>
			: freq. in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίορκον
				ὀμόσσαι</span> take <i>a false oath</i>, swear
				<i>falsely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.279
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19.260
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				282
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				232
			</span></i>; in full, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίορκον ὅρκον</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤμοσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					150
				</span></i>
			; and so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐπομνύναι</span> (v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπόμνυμι</span>); but in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.332
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐπώμοσε</span> he swore <i>a
				bootless oath</i>, i.e. one which he meant to fulfil, but the
			gods willed otherwise. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. of persons, <i>forsworn, perjured</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				804
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				179a
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Crete</span>), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				1355
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				399
			</span></i>,al.: 
				Sup.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					6.48
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					6.9.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
